{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":14,"ref":"numbers 16:14","book":"numbers","lang":"de","chapter":16,"translation":"Auch ⟨hast du⟩ uns nicht in ein Land gebracht, das von Milch und Honig fließt, und ⟨hast⟩ uns kein Erbe von Feldern und Weinbergen gegeben. Willst du den Männern dort die Augen ausbohren? Wir werden nicht hinaufkommen.","tokens":[{"surface":"אף","gloss":"Auch"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"nicht"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"in"},{"surface":"ארץ","gloss":"ein Land"},{"surface":"זבת","gloss":"das von … fließt"},{"surface":"חלב","gloss":"Milch"},{"surface":"ודבש","gloss":"und Honig"},{"surface":"הביאתנו","gloss":"hast du uns gebracht"},{"surface":"ותתן","gloss":"und ⟨hast⟩ … gegeben"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"uns"},{"surface":"נחלת","gloss":"⟨ein⟩ Erbe"},{"surface":"שדה","gloss":"von Feldern"},{"surface":"וכרם","gloss":"und Weinbergen"},{"surface":"העיני","gloss":"die Augen"},{"surface":"האנשים","gloss":"den Männern"},{"surface":"ההם","gloss":"dort"},{"surface":"תנקר","gloss":"Willst du … ausbohren"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"nicht"},{"surface":"נעלה","gloss":"Wir werden hinaufkommen"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T05:24:23.519781100Z","model":"glm-5.2"}